      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should probably see a doctor eventually but i'm just trying to get through today. since i'm already taking the omeprazole every day, won't that protect my stomach lining from the ibuprofen? like, can't the omeprazole just cancel out the side effects so i can take the advil for the toothache?",
